# Optional repository-root env file, read by the dev runner and build configs.
# Copy it to `.env`, which is gitignored. `.env.local` and the process
# environment override it. Never commit either file.

# Reuse one web dev login across worktrees on the same hostname. Generate the
# value once with `openssl rand -hex 32`; see
# docs/operations/development.md#reusable-dev-credential.
# LOOM_DEV_AUTH_TOKEN=
